{{Quote|A system which does not appear on Imperial charts but is represented in the art of the ancient people of this sector. I believe they call this "Atollon," now the home of your rebel base.|[[Grand Admiral]] [[Mitth'raw'nuruodo|Thrawn]], to [[Agent]] [[Alexsandr Kallus|Kallus]]|<ref name="Zero Hour" />}}
The '''Atollon system''' was a [[star system]] located in the [[Lothal sector]] of the [[Outer Rim Territories]].<ref name="Appendix" /> The most notable [[planet]] of this system was [[Atollon]].<ref name="The Forgotten Droid" />

